## 🧠 Core Skills 核心技能拆解

### 1. Brand Value Investing 品牌價值投資

**Key Concept 核心理念**

- Brands are the ultimate moat — pricing power, emotional connection, cultural significance
- 品牌是終極護城河——定價權、情感連結、文化意義
- Buy undervalued brands, restore their prestige, expand globally
- 買入被低估的品牌，恢復其聲望，全球擴張
- "Star brands" — brands with timeless quality, global reach, strong profitability
- 「星級品牌」——具有永恆品質、全球觸及、強大獲利能力的品牌

**The LVMH Portfolio LVMH 品牌組合**

| Category 類別 | Brands 品牌 | Strategy 策略 |
|-------------|-----------|------------|
| **Fashion & Leather 時尚皮具** | Louis Vuitton, Dior, Fendi, Celine, Loewe | Raise prices, limit supply, control distribution 漲價、限量、控管通路 |
| **Wines & Spirits 葡萄酒烈酒** | Moët & Chandon, Hennessy, Dom Pérignon, Krug | Heritage storytelling, aging scarcity 傳承故事、陳年稀缺 |
| **Perfumes & Cosmetics 香水美妝** | Guerlain, Givenchy, Benefit, Fresh | Expand into Asia, digital channels 拓展亞洲、數位通路 |
| **Watches & Jewelry 腕錶珠寶** | Bulgari, Tiffany & Co., TAG Heuer, Hublot | Acquire, integrate, elevate 收購、整合、提升 |
| **Selective Retailing 精選零售** | DFS, Sephora, Le Bon Marché | Control customer experience 掌控客戶體驗 |

